### 3. How to Treat the Home Office
Because you have $11,200 in self-employment (1099/freelance) income from graphic design, you can deduct your home office expenses against *that specific income*. Your home office is 165 sq ft out of 690 sq ft, which means it takes up **23.9%** of your home. 

