*   **Simplified Method:** 165 sq ft × $5 per sq ft = **$825** deduction.
*   **Actual Expenses Method:** 23.9% of your rent ($2,400/month × 12 months = $28,800/year). 23.9% of $28,800 is **$6,883.20**. You can also deduct 23.9% of your utilities and renter's insurance. 

